{
  "uid": "seatrush-on-sale",
  "title": "SeatRush / On-sale overview",
  "description": "The first minute of a flash on-sale, which is the only minute that matters. Left to right it follows one buyer: the lobby fills, the doors open, the queue drains into the purchase area at the admission rate, holds are taken, and seats are sold.\n\nEvery gauge here describes state that lives in Redis rather than in a pod, so each replica publishes its own reading of the same number: they are aggregated with max and never with sum (README section 14.1). The counters are the opposite and are summed, because each pod counts the work it did.\n\nProvisioned from deploy/grafana/dashboards; edits in this UI are not saved back.",
  "tags": [
    "seatrush"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "The sale",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Seats left",
      "description": "The counter in Redis the sale is bounded by, not a count of the seat hash. One series per live sale, by event id.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (event) (seatrush_seats_available)",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{event}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Sold out progress",
      "description": "Seats taken as a share of the venue, held seats included: the question is how close the sale is to having nothing left, and a held seat is not available to anybody.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1 - max by (event) (seatrush_seats_available)\n  / max by (event) (seatrush_seats_capacity)",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{event}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Waiting",
      "description": "The lobby and the queue together, per sale. Summed over the two states of one pod and then maxed over the pods, because every pod reads the same Redis keys.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (event) (sum without (state) (seatrush_queue_length))",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{event}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
