    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Admissions and freed slots per second",
      "description": "How fast the door is letting buyers through, and where the room to do it came from: a slot released by a checkout that ended, or one the clock took back. A sale whose room comes mostly from expiries is one where buyers arrive faster than they finish.",
