    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Holds given back per second",
      "description": "A hold leaves in one of three ways: the user drops it, the checkout that froze it releases it as a compensation, or the sweeper takes it when its five minutes are up. A sale dominated by expiries is a sale where seats are being parked and abandoned.",
